@lang en
IMPORT `pvi-health-nouns`

-- Fixtures for the tests of the PVI comprehensive health care rules: named people, certificates,
-- facilities, treatments and claims. No directives here; every test module imports this one.
--
-- Every amount below is a HYPOTHETICAL scenario value (the document states no premium, sum
-- insured or limit; those are in the schedule, outside it). Where a test turns on a figure the
-- document DOES state (an age, a period, a percentage), the figure is in the test, not here.

§ `Fixtures`

§§ `People`

`a healthy status` MEANS `A health status` WITH
    `suffering from a mental illness`            IS FALSE
    `suffering from leprosy`                     IS FALSE
    `suffering from cancer`                      IS FALSE
    `rate of disability or permanent injury`     IS 0
    `under treatment for an illness or injury`   IS FALSE

GIVEN `the date of birth` IS A DATE
      `a woman` IS A BOOLEAN
      `continuously insured since 60` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `An insured person`
`a healthy citizen born on` `the date of birth` `, a woman:` `a woman` `, continuously insured since 60:` `continuously insured since 60` MEANS
    `An insured person` WITH
        `date of birth`                              IS `the date of birth`
        `a woman`                                    IS `a woman`
        `residence status`                           IS `a Vietnamese citizen`
        `health status when the insurance was taken out` IS `a healthy status`
        `continuously insured with PVI since age 60` IS `continuously insured since 60`

-- A woman of 35 in 2026 (born 15 May 1990).
`the adult woman` MEANS `a healthy citizen born on` (YMD 1990 5 15) `, a woman:` TRUE `, continuously insured since 60:` FALSE
-- A man of 40 in 2026.
`the adult man` MEANS `a healthy citizen born on` (YMD 1986 2 1) `, a woman:` FALSE `, continuously insured since 60:` FALSE
-- A child of 5 in mid-2026 (born 1 March 2021): 4 on 1 January 2026, 5 from 1 March 2026.
`the child of five` MEANS `a healthy citizen born on` (YMD 2021 3 1) `, a woman:` FALSE `, continuously insured since 60:` FALSE
-- A child of 7 in 2026 (born 1 March 2019).
`the child of seven` MEANS `a healthy citizen born on` (YMD 2019 3 1) `, a woman:` FALSE `, continuously insured since 60:` FALSE

§§ `The schedule (hypothetical amounts)`

`the schedule` MEANS `The schedule of benefits` WITH
    `the sum insured`                            IS 200_000_000
    `sum insured for personal accident`          IS 100_000_000
    `limit for hospitalisation`                  IS  60_000_000
    `limit for surgery`                          IS  40_000_000
    `limit for outpatient treatment`             IS  10_000_000
    `sum insured for dental care`                IS   5_000_000
    `limit for maternity`                        IS  20_000_000
    `sum insured for death from illness`         IS  50_000_000

-- Large limits, so the 60-day cap of A.2.3(a) is the binding one.
`a schedule with large limits` MEANS `The schedule of benefits` WITH
    `the sum insured`                            IS 900_000_000
    `sum insured for personal accident`          IS 100_000_000
    `limit for hospitalisation`                  IS 500_000_000
    `limit for surgery`                          IS 100_000_000
    `limit for outpatient treatment`             IS  10_000_000
    `sum insured for dental care`                IS   5_000_000
    `limit for maternity`                        IS  20_000_000
    `sum insured for death from illness`         IS  50_000_000

-- A limit of 6,000,000 for hospitalisation, for the scenario where several layers interact.
`a schedule with a small hospital limit` MEANS `The schedule of benefits` WITH
    `the sum insured`                            IS 200_000_000
    `sum insured for personal accident`          IS 100_000_000
    `limit for hospitalisation`                  IS   6_000_000
    `limit for surgery`                          IS  40_000_000
    `limit for outpatient treatment`             IS  10_000_000
    `sum insured for dental care`                IS   5_000_000
    `limit for maternity`                        IS  20_000_000
    `sum insured for death from illness`         IS  50_000_000

§§ `Certificate periods`

GIVEN `the start` IS A DATE
      `the end` IS A DATE
      `the riders` IS A BOOLEAN
      `no higher` IS A BOOLEAN
      `paid` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A certificate period`
`a period from` `the start` `to` `the end` `, all riders:` `the riders` `, no higher:` `no higher` `, premium paid:` `paid` MEANS
    `A certificate period` WITH
        `start date`                             IS `the start`
        `end date`                               IS `the end`
        `includes outpatient treatment`          IS `the riders`
        `includes dental care`                   IS `the riders`
        `includes maternity`                     IS `the riders`
        `includes death from illness`            IS `the riders`
        `benefits no higher than the previous certificate` IS `no higher`
        `premium paid in full and on time`       IS `paid`

`2026, every rider` MEANS `a period from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, all riders:` TRUE `, no higher:` TRUE `, premium paid:` TRUE
`2025, every rider` MEANS `a period from` (YMD 2025 1 1) `to` (YMD 2025 12 31) `, all riders:` TRUE `, no higher:` TRUE `, premium paid:` TRUE
`2024, every rider` MEANS `a period from` (YMD 2024 1 1) `to` (YMD 2024 12 31) `, all riders:` TRUE `, no higher:` TRUE `, premium paid:` TRUE
`2026, no rider` MEANS `a period from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, all riders:` FALSE `, no higher:` TRUE `, premium paid:` TRUE
`2025, no rider` MEANS `a period from` (YMD 2025 1 1) `to` (YMD 2025 12 31) `, all riders:` FALSE `, no higher:` TRUE `, premium paid:` TRUE
-- 2026 with every rider after a 2025 certificate with none: the benefits went UP.
`2026, every rider, an upgrade` MEANS `a period from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, all riders:` TRUE `, no higher:` FALSE `, premium paid:` TRUE
`2026, every rider, premium unpaid` MEANS `a period from` (YMD 2026 1 1) `to` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, all riders:` TRUE `, no higher:` TRUE `, premium paid:` FALSE

-- One supplementary benefit at a time, on 2026.
GIVEN `outpatient` IS A BOOLEAN
      `dental` IS A BOOLEAN
      `maternity` IS A BOOLEAN
      `death` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A certificate period`
`2026 with outpatient:` `outpatient` `, dental:` `dental` `, maternity:` `maternity` `, death:` `death` MEANS
    `A certificate period` WITH
        `start date`                             IS YMD 2026 1 1
        `end date`                               IS YMD 2026 12 31
        `includes outpatient treatment`          IS `outpatient`
        `includes dental care`                   IS `dental`
        `includes maternity`                     IS `maternity`
        `includes death from illness`            IS `death`
        `benefits no higher than the previous certificate` IS TRUE
        `premium paid in full and on time`       IS TRUE

§§ `Certificates`

GIVEN `this period` IS A `A certificate period`
      `earlier periods` IS A LIST OF `A certificate period`
      `the schedule used` IS A `The schedule of benefits`
      `the programme` IS A NUMBER
      `shows the waiting periods` IS A BOOLEAN
      `with a parent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `parents' sums insured` IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      `early termination` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A `A certificate`
`a certificate for` `this period` `after` `earlier periods` `, schedule` `the schedule used` `, programme` `the programme` `, waiting periods shown:` `shows the waiting periods` `, with a parent:` `with a parent` `, parents' sums insured` `parents' sums insured` `, terminated early on` `early termination` MEANS
    `A certificate` WITH
        `this period`                            IS `this period`
        `earlier periods at PVI`                 IS `earlier periods`
        `programme`                              IS `the programme`
        `schedule`                               IS `the schedule used`
        `premium`                                IS 3_650_000
        `shows the waiting periods of its benefits` IS `shows the waiting periods`
        `on the same contract as the father or mother` IS `with a parent`
        `sums insured of the father or mother on that contract` IS `parents' sums insured`
        `date of early termination`              IS `early termination`

-- First year with PVI: waiting periods run from 1 January 2026.
`the first-year certificate` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` EMPTY `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
-- Third year, renewed continuously: waiting periods run from 1 January 2024.
`the renewed certificate` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
-- The same history, but the 2026 certificate raised the benefits (riders added).
`the upgraded certificate` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider, an upgrade` `after` (LIST `2025, no rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
-- Renewed, but 2025 had no rider: the riders' waiting periods run from 2026.
`the certificate renewed without riders in 2025` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` (LIST `2025, no rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
`the renewed certificate with no rider` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, no rider` `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
`the renewed certificate, premium unpaid` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider, premium unpaid` `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
`the first-year certificate not showing waiting periods` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` EMPTY `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` FALSE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
`the renewed certificate with large limits` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `a schedule with large limits` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
-- A child's renewed certificate, on a parent's contract whose sum insured is at least the child's.
`the child's renewed certificate` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `a schedule with a small hospital limit` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` TRUE `, parents' sums insured` (LIST 300_000_000, 200_000_000) `, terminated early on` NOTHING
`the child's first-year certificate` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` EMPTY `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` TRUE `, parents' sums insured` (LIST 300_000_000) `, terminated early on` NOTHING
-- Renewed, and terminated early by PVI with effect from 1 July 2026.
`the renewed certificate terminated on 1 July 2026` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` (JUST (YMD 2026 7 1))
-- Renewed, on programme 3.
`the renewed certificate on programme 3` MEANS
    `a certificate for` `2026, every rider` `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 3 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING
-- Renewed, with one rider at a time.
GIVEN `outpatient` IS A BOOLEAN
      `dental` IS A BOOLEAN
      `maternity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A certificate`
`the renewed certificate with outpatient:` `outpatient` `, dental:` `dental` `, maternity:` `maternity` MEANS
    `a certificate for` (`2026 with outpatient:` `outpatient` `, dental:` `dental` `, maternity:` `maternity` `, death:` TRUE) `after` (LIST `2025, every rider`, `2024, every rider`) `, schedule` `the schedule` `, programme` 1 `, waiting periods shown:` TRUE `, with a parent:` FALSE `, parents' sums insured` EMPTY `, terminated early on` NOTHING

§§ `Facilities`

GIVEN `the kind` IS A `A kind of medical facility`
      `international department` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in Vietnam` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in Hanoi or HCMC` IS A BOOLEAN
      `licensed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a hospital` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a proper clinic` IS A BOOLEAN
      `documents` IS A BOOLEAN
      `agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
      `refused` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A medical facility`
`a facility:` `the kind` `, international department` `international department` `, in Vietnam` `in Vietnam` `, in Hanoi or HCMC` `in Hanoi or HCMC` `, licensed` `licensed` `, equipped as a hospital` `a hospital` `, equipped as a clinic` `a proper clinic` `, documents` `documents` `, PVI agreement` `agreement` `, refused` `refused` MEANS
    `A medical facility` WITH
        `kind`                                   IS `the kind`
        `the treatment was in its international department` IS `international department`
        `in Vietnam`                             IS `in Vietnam`
        `in Hanoi or Ho Chi Minh City`           IS `in Hanoi or HCMC`
        `licensed to operate lawfully`           IS `licensed`
        `able to diagnose, treat and operate`    IS `a hospital`
        `equipped for inpatient treatment with daily monitoring` IS `a hospital`
        `solely for convalescence, the elderly, addiction, mental disorders or leprosy` IS FALSE
        `holds a valid business licence and its own seal` IS `a proper clinic`
        `able to examine, diagnose and treat`    IS `a proper clinic`
        `issues documents and invoices as the Ministry of Finance requires` IS `documents`
        `has a cooperation agreement with PVI`   IS `agreement`
        `on PVI's list of facilities refused for claims` IS `refused`
        `daily price of its cheapest single room` IS 1_000_000

`a public hospital in Hanoi` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a public hospital` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` TRUE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` TRUE `, equipped as a clinic` TRUE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
`the international department of a public hospital in Hanoi` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a public hospital` `, international department` TRUE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` TRUE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` TRUE `, equipped as a clinic` TRUE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
`a private hospital in Ho Chi Minh City` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a private or international hospital` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` TRUE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` TRUE `, equipped as a clinic` TRUE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
`a hospital in Singapore` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a private or international hospital` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` FALSE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` FALSE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` TRUE `, equipped as a clinic` TRUE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
`a clinic in Da Nang` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a clinic` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` FALSE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` FALSE `, equipped as a clinic` TRUE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
`a clinic in Da Nang on PVI's refused list` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a clinic` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` FALSE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` FALSE `, equipped as a clinic` TRUE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` TRUE
-- A licensed private dental clinic in Hanoi with no PVI agreement.
`a private clinic in Hanoi` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a clinic` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` TRUE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` FALSE `, equipped as a clinic` TRUE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
-- A clinic without a business licence or seal: not a clinic as the Rules define one.
`a clinic without a business licence` MEANS
    `a facility:` `a clinic` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` FALSE `, licensed` TRUE `, equipped as a hospital` FALSE `, equipped as a clinic` FALSE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
`an unlicensed facility issuing no invoices` MEANS
    `a facility:` `another medical facility` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` FALSE `, licensed` FALSE `, equipped as a hospital` FALSE `, equipped as a clinic` FALSE `, documents` FALSE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE
`an unlicensed facility issuing invoices` MEANS
    `a facility:` `another medical facility` `, international department` FALSE `, in Vietnam` TRUE `, in Hanoi or HCMC` FALSE `, licensed` FALSE `, equipped as a hospital` FALSE `, equipped as a clinic` FALSE `, documents` TRUE `, PVI agreement` FALSE `, refused` FALSE

§§ `Treatments`

GIVEN `bed` IS A NUMBER
      `other` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A day in hospital`
`a day costing` `bed` `for the bed and` `other` `otherwise` MEANS
    `A day in hospital` WITH
        `bed charge`                             IS `bed`
        `other medical costs`                    IS `other`
        `non-medical costs`                      IS 100_000

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
      d IS A `A day in hospital`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A day in hospital`
n `days of` d MEANS
    IF n AT MOST 0 THEN EMPTY ELSE d FOLLOWED BY ((n MINUS 1) `days of` d)

GIVEN `admitted` IS A BOOLEAN
      `overnight` IS A BOOLEAN
      `hours` IS A NUMBER
      `surgery` IS A BOOLEAN
      `dental` IS A BOOLEAN
      `conclusion` IS A BOOLEAN
      `protocol` IS A BOOLEAN
      `chronic` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the room used` IS A `A room`
      `the days` IS A LIST OF `A day in hospital`
GIVETH A `The treatment`
`a treatment: admitted` `admitted` `, overnight` `overnight` `, hours` `hours` `, surgery` `surgery` `, dental` `dental` `, diagnosis` `conclusion` `, protocol` `protocol` `, chronic` `chronic` `, room` `the room used` `, days` `the days` MEANS
    `The treatment` WITH
        `admitted with the facility's admission procedure` IS `admitted`
        `an admission or discharge paper issued by a hospital` IS `admitted`
        `stayed overnight in a hospital bed`     IS `overnight`
        `continuous hours at the facility`       IS `hours`
        `bed charges incurred`                   IS `admitted`
        `for a diagnosed disease under a treatment protocol` IS `protocol`
        `a surgery`                              IS `surgery`
        `the surgery is on the Ministry of Health's list` IS `surgery`
        `the surgeon holds a lawful practising certificate` IS `surgery`
        `dental treatment`                       IS `dental`
        `indicated by the treating doctor`       IS TRUE
        `the doctor is the insured person, or a spouse, parent, child or sibling of the insured person` IS FALSE
        `a doctor's conclusion of a disease`     IS `conclusion`
        `a specific treatment protocol`          IS `protocol`
        `the treating doctor concluded the disease is chronic` IS `chronic`
        `the room`                               IS `the room used`
        `the days in hospital`                   IS `the days`
        `date of the last discharge from hospital` IS NOTHING
        `days of the hospital stay before home care` IS 0

`a standard day` MEANS `a day costing` 1_000_000 `for the bed and` 2_000_000 `otherwise`

-- Three nights, 72 hours, a standard room at 1,000,000 a day plus 2,000,000 of other medical costs.
`a three-night stay` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 72 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (3 `days of` `a standard day`)
`a three-night stay for a chronic disease` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 72 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` TRUE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (3 `days of` `a standard day`)
`a three-night stay with surgery` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 72 `, surgery` TRUE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (3 `days of` `a standard day`)
`a four-night stay` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 96 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (4 `days of` `a standard day`)
`a three-night stay in a VIP room` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 72 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a room on request, a VIP room or a whole room booked` `, days` (3 `days of` (`a day costing` 5_000_000 `for the bed and` 2_000_000 `otherwise`))
`a three-night stay in intensive care` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 72 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `an intensive care unit` `, days` (3 `days of` (`a day costing` 8_000_000 `for the bed and` 2_000_000 `otherwise`))
