`a 61-day stay` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 1464 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (61 `days of` (`a day costing` 0 `for the bed and` 1_000_000 `otherwise`))
-- Admitted at 18:00, discharged at 10:00 the next morning: overnight, 16 hours.
`a 16-hour overnight stay` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 16 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (1 `days of` `a standard day`)
`a 24-hour overnight stay` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` TRUE `, hours` 24 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (1 `days of` `a standard day`)
