    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` FALSE `, hours` 8 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` (1 `days of` `a standard day`)
`a day surgery` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` TRUE `, overnight` FALSE `, hours` 8 `, surgery` TRUE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` EMPTY
`an outpatient visit` MEANS
    `a treatment: admitted` FALSE `, overnight` FALSE `, hours` 2 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` FALSE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` EMPTY
