    `a treatment: admitted` FALSE `, overnight` FALSE `, hours` 1 `, surgery` FALSE `, dental` TRUE `, diagnosis` TRUE `, protocol` TRUE `, chronic` FALSE `, room` `a standard room` `, days` EMPTY
