GIVEN `days in hospital before` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The treatment`
`home care, after a hospital stay in days of` `days in hospital before` MEANS
    `The treatment` WITH
        `admitted with the facility's admission procedure` IS FALSE
        `an admission or discharge paper issued by a hospital` IS FALSE
        `stayed overnight in a hospital bed`     IS FALSE
        `continuous hours at the facility`       IS 0
        `bed charges incurred`                   IS FALSE
        `for a diagnosed disease under a treatment protocol` IS TRUE
        `a surgery`                              IS FALSE
        `the surgery is on the Ministry of Health's list` IS FALSE
        `the surgeon holds a lawful practising certificate` IS FALSE
        `dental treatment`                       IS FALSE
        `indicated by the treating doctor`       IS TRUE
        `the doctor is the insured person, or a spouse, parent, child or sibling of the insured person` IS FALSE
        `a doctor's conclusion of a disease`     IS TRUE
        `a specific treatment protocol`          IS TRUE
        `the treating doctor concluded the disease is chronic` IS FALSE
        `the room`                               IS `a standard room`
        `the days in hospital`                   IS EMPTY
        `date of the last discharge from hospital` IS NOTHING
        `days of the hospital stay before home care` IS `days in hospital before`

§§ `History, costs, outcomes`

`no earlier history` MEANS `The history of the disease` WITH
    `the disease existed before cover began`     IS FALSE
    `date of the last treatment before cover began` IS NOTHING
    `medical symptoms existed and originated before cover began` IS FALSE

GIVEN `surgery` IS A NUMBER
      `other` IS A NUMBER
      `other insurer` IS A NUMBER
      `vitamins` IS A NUMBER
      `drugs` IS A NUMBER
      `days used` IS A NUMBER
      `paid this year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The costs claimed`
`costs: surgery` `surgery` `, other medical` `other` `, paid by another insurer` `other insurer` `, vitamins` `vitamins` `, drugs` `drugs` `, hospital days already paid` `days used` `, paid this year` `paid this year` MEANS
    `The costs claimed` WITH
        `costs of the surgery`                   IS `surgery`
        `other medical costs`                    IS `other`
        `paid under another insurance contract`  IS `other insurer`
        `cost of the vitamins or minerals`       IS `vitamins`
        `cost of the treatment drugs`            IS `drugs`
        `days of hospitalisation already paid in this insurance year` IS `days used`
        `already paid in this insurance year`    IS `paid this year`
        `scalings already paid in this insurance year` IS 0

`no other costs` MEANS
    `costs: surgery` 0 `, other medical` 0 `, paid by another insurer` 0 `, vitamins` 0 `, drugs` 0 `, hospital days already paid` 0 `, paid this year` 0

`nothing permanent` MEANS `The facts of death or permanent injury` WITH
    `outcome`                                    IS `no death and no permanent injury`
    `treatment of the injury has ended`          IS FALSE
    `already paid under Benefit 2 for the same accident` IS 0

GIVEN `the outcome` IS A `The outcome of the accident`
      `ended` IS A BOOLEAN
      `paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The facts of death or permanent injury`
`an outcome:` `the outcome` `, treatment ended` `ended` `, already paid under Benefit 2` `paid` MEANS
    `The facts of death or permanent injury` WITH
        `outcome`                                IS `the outcome`
        `treatment of the injury has ended`      IS `ended`
        `already paid under Benefit 2 for the same accident` IS `paid`

§§ `Claims`

-- The full builder: every field of `A claim`, each behind its own label.
GIVEN who IS AN `An insured person`
      cert IS A `A certificate`
      benefit IS A `A benefit`
      claimant IS A `A party`
      cause IS A `A cause`
      arose IS A DATE
      treated IS A DATE
      fac IS A `A medical facility`
      tr IS A `The treatment`
      conds IS A LIST OF `A condition`
      circs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance`
      hist IS A `The history of the disease`
      cost IS A `The costs claimed`
      dentalItems IS A LIST OF `A dental item`
      mat IS A MAYBE `A maternity event`
      outcomeFacts IS A `The facts of death or permanent injury`
      driving IS A BOOLEAN
      authorised IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a claim by` who `under` cert `for` benefit `, claimant` claimant `, cause` cause `, arising` arose `, treated` treated `at` fac `:` tr `; conditions` conds `; circumstances` circs `; history` hist `; costs` cost `; dental items` dentalItems `; maternity` mat `; death or injury` outcomeFacts `; driving` driving `; authorised` authorised MEANS
    `A claim` WITH
        `the insured`                            IS who
        `the certificate`                        IS cert
        `the benefit claimed`                    IS benefit
        `the claimant`                           IS claimant
        `the cause`                              IS cause
        `the date the event arose`               IS arose
        `the date of treatment`                  IS treated
        `the facility`                           IS fac
        `the treatment`                          IS tr
        `the conditions`                         IS conds
        `the circumstances`                      IS circs
        `the history of the disease`             IS hist
        `the costs`                              IS cost
        `the dental items`                       IS dentalItems
        `the maternity event`                    IS mat
        `the death or injury facts`              IS outcomeFacts
        `an accident while driving a vehicle`    IS driving
        `someone else is authorised to receive the money` IS authorised

-- A claim for a benefit, for an illness or an accident, by the insured person, with no earlier
-- history, no dental items, no maternity event, nothing permanent, not driving, not delegated.
GIVEN cert IS A `A certificate`
      who IS AN `An insured person`
      benefit IS A `A benefit`
      cause IS A `A cause`
      arose IS A DATE
      fac IS A `A medical facility`
      tr IS A `The treatment`
      conds IS A LIST OF `A condition`
      circs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance`
      cost IS A `The costs claimed`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a plain claim under` cert `by` who `for` benefit `, cause` cause `, arising and treated` arose `at` fac `:` tr `; conditions` conds `; circumstances` circs `; costs` cost MEANS
    `a claim by` who `under` cert `for` benefit `, claimant` `the insured person` `, cause` cause `, arising` arose `, treated` arose `at` fac `:` tr `; conditions` conds `; circumstances` circs `; history` `no earlier history` `; costs` cost `; dental items` EMPTY `; maternity` NOTHING `; death or injury` `nothing permanent` `; driving` FALSE `; authorised` FALSE

-- The claim every Part IV test starts from: the adult woman, the renewed certificate (waiting
-- periods long run), an illness, three nights at a public hospital in Hanoi on 1 June 2026.
-- With no condition and no circumstance it engages no item of Part IV.
GIVEN conds IS A LIST OF `A condition`
      circs IS A LIST OF `A circumstance`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`the base claim with conditions` conds `and circumstances` circs MEANS
    `a plain claim under` `the renewed certificate` `by` `the adult woman` `for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, arising and treated` (YMD 2026 6 1) `at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `:` `a three-night stay` `; conditions` conds `; circumstances` circs `; costs` `no other costs`
